  "body": "I filed this over in Element Web land: https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/19461 - the problem is that for accounts using SSO (in my case using github), the UX gives you the option to change your password, but that's not _really_ possible.\r\n\r\n@t3chguy I think is saying that the problem is that Synapse still returns:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    \"m.change_password\": {\r\n      \"enabled\": true\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nfor SSO accounts, when that should be false.",
